("You can imagine from what I say that my poor sister Julia and I had no great pleasure in) Tj
T*
(our lives. No servant would stay with us, and for a long time we did all the work of the) Tj
T*
(house. She was but thirty at the time of her death, and yet her hair had already begun to) Tj
T*
(whiten, even as mine has.") Tj
ET
