15.500 TL
("My dear Watson, you as a medical man are continually gaining light as to the tendencies) Tj
T*
(of a child by the study of the parents. Don't you see that the converse is equally valid.) Tj
T*
(I have frequently gained my first real insight into the character of parents by studying) Tj
